### Список предложений
GET http://localhost:4000/offers?limit=10

### Премиальные предложения для города
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/premium?city=Paris

### Детальная информация
GET http://localhost:4000/offers/{{offerId}}

### Создание предложения
POST http://localhost:4000/offers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nice flat in the city centre",
  "description": "Quiet apartment with a view of the river and a big kitchen.",
  "city": "Amsterdam",
  "previewImage": "https://16.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/1.jpg",
  "photos": [
    "https://16.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/1.jpg",
    "https://16.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/2.jpg",
    "https://16.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/3.jpg",
    "https://16.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/4.jpg",
    "https://16.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/5.jpg",
    "https://16.design.htmlacademy.pro/static/hotel/6.jpg"
  ],
  "isPremium": false,
  "type": "apartment",
  "roomsCount": 2,
  "guestsCount": 3,
  "price": 2500,
  "amenities": ["Washer", "Fridge"],
  "authorId": "{{userId}}",
  "location": {"latitude": 52.370216, "longitude": 4.895168}
}

### Редактирование предложения
PATCH http://localhost:4000/offers/{{offerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 3000
}

### Удаление предложения
DELETE http://localhost:4000/offers/{{offerId}}
